<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2013/05/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>UiPath.System.Activities</id>
    <version>19.5.0</version>
    <title>UiPath.System.Activities</title>
    <authors>UiPath</authors>
    <owners>UiPath</owners>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>true</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <licenseUrl>https://www.uipath.com/hubfs/legalspot/UiPath_EULA.pdf</licenseUrl>
    <projectUrl>https://activities.uipath.com/docs/about-the-system-activities-pack</projectUrl>
    <iconUrl>http://www.uipath.com/favicon.ico</iconUrl>
    <description>IMPORTANT: This package version requires Studio v2018.4.4 / v2019.2 or above. Installing it on versions lower than the recommended ones may cause unexpected changes in your workflows.
Core activities which enable the robots to manipulate data tables and collections, work with files and folders, communicate with Orchestrator. Package also contains workflow operators, dialog forms, debugging and invoking methods.</description>
    <releaseNotes>New Features and Improvements

The Invoke VBScript activity has been created with the purpose of adding VBScript to the list of the languages you can directly use into your processes.
The ItemInformationCollection property has been added to the Add Queue Item activity, enabling you to import an entire dictionary as information for queue items.

For the full release notes, please visit https://activities.uipath.com/docs/release-notes-system.</releaseNotes>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency id="CsvHelper" version="2.13.5" />
      <dependency id="Microsoft.AspNet.SignalR.Client" version="2.4.0" />
      <dependency id="Microsoft.Rest.ClientRuntime" version="2.3.10" />
      <dependency id="Newtonsoft.Json" version="11.0.2" />
    </dependencies>
  </metadata>
</package>